  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) 2, 30**\n\n→ 28 × **8 ÷ 30** + 13 + 2 = 50\n\n→ **28 × 4/15** + 13 + 2 = 50\n\n→ 112/15 + 13 + 2 = 50\n\n→ 112/15 + 15 ≠ 50\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**2) 2, 8**\n\n→ 28 × **2 ÷ 8 **+ 13 + 30 = 50\n\n→ **28 × 1/4** + 13 + 30 = 50\n\n→ **7 + 13 + 30** = 50\n\n→ 50 = 50\n\n→ **LHS = RHS **⇒ **Satisfies the equation.**\n\n**3) 8, 28**\n\n→ 28 × **8 ÷ 2** + 13 + 30 = 50\n\n→ **28 × 4** + 13 + 30 = 50\n\n→ **112 + 13 + 30** = 50\n\n→ 155 ≠ 50\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS **\n\n**4) 30, 50**\n\n→ 28 × **8 ÷ 2** + 13 + 50 = 30\n\n→ **28 × 4** + 13 + 50 = 30\n\n→ 112 + 13 + 50 = 30\n\n→ 175 ≠ 30\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"2, 8\".**",
